WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:04.500
Lost fifty percent? Now you need a hundred.

00:00:04.550 --> 00:00:08.300
Drawdown: the drop from your account's peak.

00:00:08.350 --> 00:00:12.700
Step one: minus fifty needs plus one hundred.

00:00:12.750 --> 00:00:16.740
Step two: ten thousand turns into five thousand.

00:00:16.790 --> 00:00:20.940
Step three: small risk keeps your drawdown shallow.

00:00:20.990 --> 00:00:24.540
Typical mistake: risking more after losses.

00:00:24.590 --> 00:00:28.140
No time to analyze the market yourself?

00:00:28.190 --> 00:00:33.070
I show my risk management live in my free group. Comment GOLD.
